          <p>The Old Swan reality. Lead, copper, plastic push-fit, 1970s compression fittings all in the same house. Joins between different materials fail at the connection. We figure out what's there before quoting.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="pf-why-item">
          <h3>NHS Staff and Student Rentals</h3>
          <p>Alder Hey Hospital is just north. Liverpool Heart and Chest, Rathbone Hospital are close. Liverpool universities are a short bus ride away. The streets around them have a strong professional rental base. We cover them 24/7.</p>
        </div>

