          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">20 min response</span></div>
          <p>Victorian lead meets 1970s copper meets modern plastic. The connection points fail first. We identify what's there, cut out the failed join and use the right transition fitting. Same-visit fix.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>HMO Boiler Breakdowns</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">20 min response</span></div>
          <p>A boiler down in a six-tenant HMO means everyone loses heat and hot water at once. We prioritise HMO calls and provide written reports for landlord insurance claims.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Condensate Pipe Freezing</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">20 min response</span></div>
          <p>Modern boilers drain a condensate liquid through a plastic pipe. In Old Swan terraces this pipe often runs outside along the back wall. Cold spells freeze it. The boiler locks out with a fault code. We thaw it and lag it on the same visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Victorian Lead Pipe Failures</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">20 min response</span></div>
          <p>Original lead supply pipes from the 1880s are still in service in many Old Swan terraces. After 130 years they fail without warning. We replace with copper or MDPE plastic. Most jobs same-visit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>CP12 for L13 Landlords</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">Same-day available</span></div>
          <p>L13 has one of the highest rental shares in Liverpool. We do CP12 gas safety paperwork from £80. Same-day if needed. Batch rates for landlords with several Old Swan properties.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="job-card">
          <h3>Drain Blockages</h3>
          <div class="job-meta"><span class="job-price">Gas Safe registered</span><span class="job-time">20 min response</span></div>
          <p>The 130-year-old clay drain runs are at the end of their life. Lead joint seals fail. Tree roots find their way in. We clear with high-pressure jetting. CCTV survey on request to find the source.</p>
        </div>
